  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the approved plans, as set out in the attached schedule which forms part of this notice. \rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\rDesign and Access Statement \rEFP/26005 - 1\rEFP/26005 - 2\rFRA \rHSIA \rHMO management statement \r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "No independent cooking or laundry facilities shall be installed in any of the respective bedrooms, and the communal kitchen/dinning/living room on the ground floor shall be retained in perpetuity.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 5 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units. \r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "The rear garden of the site must be accessible and usable at all times by all future occupiers for as long as the property remains in (HMO) use.  \r\rReason: In the interests of the residential amenity and providing a good quality form of accommodation for future residents of the HMO in accordance with the Local Plan.\r",
    "Prior to occupation of the development hereby permitted, refuse storage facilities including facilities for the recycling of waste to satisfy the future number of occupiers on site, shall be provided within the development, in accordance with the London Borough of Enfield - Waste and Recycling Planning Storage Guidance 2024. \r\rThe refuse storage shall have no means of access opening on to and over the public highway.  \r\rReason: In order to facilitate efficient, safe and clean removal of household refuse, the location and accessibility of refuse storage plus to maintain safety on the Highway.\r"
  ],
